# The legacy RFU translation units register large global tables with ASan,
# which keeps unrelated hardware sections alive despite --gc-sections.  The
# portable fallback is exercised by the sanitized smoke through its call
# boundary; keep these legacy objects uninstrumented so unused RFU transport
# code remains discarded and cannot introduce fake link requirements.
